Package: bayesfertility
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Peristera-Kostaki Models of Age-Specific Fertility
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Herb", "Susmann", email = "herbps10@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits hierarchical Bayesian Peristera-Kostaki models of
    age-specific fertility rates using 'Stan'. Schedule parameters governing
    the fertility curve can depend on covariates through parametric and
    smooth (penalized) terms, with posterior inference via 'cmdstanr'.
    Provides tools for prediction, posterior predictive checks, and deriving
    quantities such as the total fertility rate.
Depends:
  R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
  bayesplot,
  dplyr,
  ggplot2,
  instantiate,
  matrixStats,
  prettyunits,
  rstantools,
  stringr
Additional_repositories:
  https://mc-stan.org/r-packages/
SystemRequirements: CmdStan (https://mc-stan.org/users/interfaces/cmdstan)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
